AI Knowledge Infrastructure for Equipment Service Companies
🔎 Problem

Equipment & mechanical service companies (5–30 techs) struggle with:

Manuals scattered across PDFs and drives

Senior techs constantly interrupted

Slow onboarding of new technicians

Tribal knowledge concentrated in a few individuals

Costly troubleshooting inefficiencies

Knowledge is fragmented. Growth is bottlenecked by information access.

💡 Solution

We build an internal knowledge system that:

Ingests company manuals, SOPs, and service documents

Makes them instantly searchable from a mobile-friendly interface

Delivers step-by-step troubleshooting guidance in real time

Reduces senior-tech interruptions

Accelerates technician ramp-up

Techs type the issue → get relevant procedures instantly.

No digging through PDFs.
No constant phone calls.
No knowledge loss.

🎯 Target Customer (ICP)

Equipment & mechanical service companies:

5–30 field technicians

$2M–$25M revenue

Owner-led or Ops Director decision-maker

Documentation-heavy workflow

Recurring service contracts

Training and troubleshooting bottlenecks

Examples:

HVAC service companies

Pump & motor maintenance

Commercial refrigeration

Water filtration systems

Industrial equipment maintenance

💰 Pricing (Early Stage)

Setup: $3,000 – $7,000
Monthly Subscription: $1,500 – $4,000 (based on technician count)

Future tiers scale with analytics, integrations, and enterprise features.

